  "open_questions": [
    "Source: Afton's own HiTEC 12204L PDS 'HiTEC® 12204L HDEO Additive Package', printed edition '06/17' (© 2017 Afton Chemical Corporation; PDF created 2017-06-16), retrieved as the Internet Archive original-bytes copy captured 2020-10-23 (SHA-256 7a1e57d81d66b52b83215da261732256867d89b651c75334068022362a74183e), p.2 (p.1 is the cover). Afton's live site blocks automated access. The same document is the source of AFTON_HITEC_12250. The archive's HiTEC 12200 bulletin DL2-14639.pdf (08/18) prints no HiTEC 12204L properties; it is used only for the premix formula and route context (see below).",
    "Handling information printed for 'HiTEC® 12204L and HiTEC® 12250' (p.2), no template field: Max Handling Temp: 70˚C; Shelf Life: 3 months @ 45°C, 36 months @ ambient (10-40°C). Also printed, no template field: Specific Gravity @ 15.6/15.6°C 0.972.",
    "KV40, sulfated ash, all elements (Ca, Mg, Zn, P, B, Mo, N, S) and pour point are not printed in the PDS; left Missing. Nothing is inferred from HiTEC 12200 (DL2-14639.pdf) or HiTEC 12250, including the premix formula; HiTEC 12200 also prints KV100 190 mm2/s, but that value is not used here."
  ],
